35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The ledger shows fixed costs dominate, but attendance is highly skewed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The treasurer's logs confirm my fear. Chasing individual payments is a full-time job.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The sign-in sheets show a small group does almost everything.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The data confirms my suspicion. The hesitation is about perceived value, not just price.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The bank statements show a third of renewals only cleared after two rounds of reminders.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, If a few people carry the load, a flat fee feels unfair to them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, That is exactly why I am worried. We cannot afford the admin cost of chasing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
