43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, Chasing is a symptom. The real issue is that people don't feel they belong to the club.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The sign-up records show eleven mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
