46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A flat annual fee is the only way to stop the administrative bleed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,A flat fee ignores the fact that some people use the club daily and others barely at all.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A flat fee removes the hesitation. If you pay once, you are in. No weighing up.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,A flat fee is the only way to stop the administrative bleed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am leaning towards a flat fee, but we need to set it correctly.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am with you. The admin cost of a tiered system is simply too high.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am concerned about the fairness to the heavy users, but I see the admin point.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The hesitation is the real cost. A flat fee removes the friction.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,The bank statements show the cash flow is thin. A flat fee is the only way to stop the administrative bleed.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
